{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/LoveCraft_Steam_text_banners_1.png?t=1749217272\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83d\udc8c\u00a0<i>OFFICIAL LETTER FROM CUBIVERSITY ADMISSIONS!\u00a0</i>\ud83d\udc8c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dear Student, Congratulations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are thrilled to inform you that you have been accepted into Cubiversity, the world\u2019s leading institution for adventurers. Your journey begins now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet your charming classmates, and join the prestigious Crafting Club, a cozy place to sew together something special.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/LoveCraft_Steam_text_banners_2.png?t=1749217272\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Please note the following program highlights:</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bite-sized</strong><br>Every playthrough is a 20-minute adventure, perfect for sneaky lunch breaks or late-night love quests.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choices that matter</strong><br>Each choice you make leads to a different ending. But no 3 a.m. breakdowns over a wrong dialogue option, we promise!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Romance-by-elimination</strong><br>Unravel your favorite (or least favorite) love story one thread at a time.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Inclusive and heartfelt</strong><br>Love comes in many forms, and LoveCraft makes room for all of them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Handmade art</strong><br>Adorably expressive characters by Tanupoki and lush backgrounds by Toiu, no AI assets used.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/LoveCraft_Steam_text_banners_3.png?t=1749217272\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We look forward to having you join us next week.<br>Yours sincerely,<br>Jean, President of the Crafting Club \ud83d\udc8b</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3691640?t=1749217272","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3691640?t=1749217272","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/6e7780cced036b27ccc6dafc9324bf0f50aa5d89/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749217272","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/6e7780cced036b27ccc6dafc9324bf0f50aa5d89/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749217272","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/LoveCraft_Steam_text_banners_1.png?t=1749217272\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83d\udc8c\u00a0<i>OFFICIAL LETTER FROM CUBIVERSITY ADMISSIONS!\u00a0</i>\ud83d\udc8c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dear Student, Congratulations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are thrilled to inform you that you have been accepted into Cubiversity, the world\u2019s leading institution for adventurers. Your journey begins now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet your charming classmates, and join the prestigious Crafting Club, a cozy place to sew together something special.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/LoveCraft_Steam_text_banners_2.png?t=1749217272\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Please note the following program highlights:</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bite-sized</strong><br>Every playthrough is a 20-minute adventure, perfect for sneaky lunch breaks or late-night love quests.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choices that matter</strong><br>Each choice you make leads to a different ending. But no 3 a.m. breakdowns over a wrong dialogue option, we promise!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Romance-by-elimination</strong><br>Unravel your favorite (or least favorite) love story one thread at a time.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Inclusive and heartfelt</strong><br>Love comes in many forms, and LoveCraft makes room for all of them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Handmade art</strong><br>Adorably expressive characters by Tanupoki and lush backgrounds by Toiu, no AI assets used.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/LoveCraft_Steam_text_banners_3.png?t=1749217272\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We look forward to having you join us next week.<br>Yours sincerely,<br>Jean, President of the Crafting Club \ud83d\udc8b</p>","developers":["Toiu"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/697d75a995588fcc35003ccecc33794e6c4fb572/header.jpg?t=1749217272","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257152259,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152259/movie480.mp4?t=1749215036","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152259/movie_max.mp4?t=1749215036"},"name":"LoveCraft Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite